# The singular of the three rungs whose noun is a whole word, and of the status
# line's source count. Turkish spells both the same — a noun after a numeral
# does not inflect — so these look redundant here and are not: they exist so
# that English does not read "1 years ago" on every third row.
#
# The general fix is `msgid_plural`, which `po.rs` does not carry and says so.
# It would buy Turkish nothing, which is why it has not been added for two
# languages; the day a third arrives that needs it, that is the change.

msgid "1 day ago"
msgstr "1 gün önce"

msgid "1 month ago"
msgstr "1 ay önce"

msgid "1 year ago"
msgstr "1 yıl önce"

